  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4402.05 Electronic record",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4402.05 “Electronic record” means “electronic record” as defined in RSA 294-E:2, VII namely, a “record created, generated, sent, communicated, received, or stored by electronic means.”\n\nSource. #9377, eff 1-30-09; ss by #10021, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13038, eff 4-20-20 (formerly Saf-C 4402.04)",
